ASK { gmeow:Man a owl:Class . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:Man MUST NOT exist as an owl:Class — per-value Person subclasses are forbidden. Mirrors test_gender_values_are_individuals_not_subclasses (rejected class: Man)." .

