    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
ASK { gmeow:hasGenderIdentity a owl:ObjectProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:hasGenderIdentity MUST be an owl:ObjectProperty. Mirrors test_value_properties_are_functional_facets_nonfunctional (hasGenderIdentity is-ObjectProperty assertion)." .

