ASK { gmeow:sex a owl:DatatypeProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:sex MUST NOT exist as a DatatypeProperty — greenfield removal of the old flat sex literal. Mirrors test_sex_assigned_at_birth_is_recorded_not_a_facet (flat-sex-DatatypeProperty guard)." .

