ASK { gmeow:sex a owl:ObjectProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:sex MUST NOT exist as an owl:ObjectProperty — greenfield removal of the old flat sex property. Mirrors test_sex_assigned_at_birth_is_recorded_not_a_facet (flat-sex-ObjectProperty guard)." .
